# Hazoret, Godseeker (5/3 indestructible, haste; "Hazoret can't attack or block unless you have max speed"). Casting it gives Bot1 speed 1; Lightning Bolt
# to Bot2's face on each of Bot1's turns raises it by one (once a turn): 2 after turn 1, 3 after turn 3, max speed (4) after turn 5.
# Turn 3 (speed 3): Hazoret has haste but is not allowed to attack (Bot1's Memnite is, but stays home). On Bot2's turn 4 it may not block Memnite either (Bot1's own Memnite may).
# Turn 5: max speed. Turn 6, Hazoret (untapped) blocks Memnite and takes 1, indestructible or not. Turn 7, still at max speed: it attacks for 5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Hazoret, Godseeker
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Memnite
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

